"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "avoid" | 0 | "Do not introduce an interface while leaving repeated concrete selection in every caller."
"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "avoid" | 1 | "Do not extract each switch into a differently named helper."
"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "avoid" | 2 | "Do not create one facade per concrete implementation while preserving the variant taxonomy in callers."
"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "avoid" | 3 | "Do not suppress all member cases merely because the correlation identifies a likely abstraction."
"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "avoid" | 4 | "Do not treat creation of a named interface as proof that coupling improved."
"MPR-62fc8a57f021a4f14e846c371619c0a48b2c8e5db45e1b8882f48486779aa2cb" | "lead" | 0 | "Review the linked selection sites, observed messages, and variant mappings before choosing a role or centralizing selection."

